    {
      "source": "This is the class exposed to handler methods by Spring WebFlux,\ntypically consumed through a declaration of the\n<a href=\"../../ui/Model.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ui\"><code>Model</code></a> interface as a parameter type.\nThere is typically no need to create it within user code.\nIf necessary a handler method can return a regular <code>java.util.Map</code>,\nlikely a <code>java.util.ConcurrentMap</code>, for a pre-determined model.",
      "translation": "这是 Spring WebFlux 向处理器方法暴露的类，通常通过声明 `<a href=\"../../ui/Model.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ui\"><code>Model</code></a>` 接口作为参数类型来消费。通常无需在用户代码中创建它。如有必要，处理器方法可以返回一个常规的 `<code>java.util.Map</code>`，很可能是 `<code>java.util.ConcurrentMap</code>`，用于预定的模型。",
      "count": 2
    },
